# Run Flow

## User launches WoW after setup

Tags: run-flow

* Open the WoW on Silicon app
* Wait for app to be ready
* Select runner "CrossOver" from the runner dropdown
* Browse and select WoW folder "/tmp/test-wow"
* Click the "Setup" button
* Wait for setup to complete
* Verify "Run" button is visible
* Click the "Run" button
* Verify alert "WoW launched" is displayed

## User cannot run with invalid configuration

Tags: run-flow, validation

* Open the WoW on Silicon app
* Wait for app to be ready
* Verify "Setup" button is visible
* Verify "Setup" button is disabled
